# Simulation, then meshes

- Miniplex entities own position, health, shotgun, slash, and silhouette. Meshes copy transforms in PresentationSystem.
- Talk across systems only through `EventBus` (`domain:action`). Do not import CombatSystem from WaveSystem.
- Put every balance number in `src/core/Constants.ts`.
- Gameplay reads `InputSample` only — never raw keyboard/gamepad/touch events.
- `CameraSystem` owns over-the-shoulder and isometric. Default new run is OTS. Toggle is a control, not a cutscene.
- `GameState.reset()` plus dispose/pool recycle on every restart. Leaked listeners and undisposed geometries are bugs.
- Use `renderer.setAnimationLoop`, cap delta at 0.1, fixed 1/60 combat step.
- Do not add React Three Fiber, Drei, EffectComposer, or shadow maps unless a spec says so.
- Do not add Demolisher voice lines.

```ts
// BAD — mesh is the player
hero.mesh.position.x += speed;

// GOOD — sim first, view later
hero.position.x += speed * dt;
hero.mesh.position.copy(hero.position);
```
